eople who she  possesses great trust in regardless  Coco's abilities were recognized by the  talent scouts of hopes Peak Academy who  admitted her into the seventieth class  and rather notably it should be said  that her father Jing kirie kirie was the  headmaster of this institution during  her time at the academy she and her  father appeared to have developed some  sort of working relationship as Kyoko  conducted many investigations for him  including an attempt to look into ISA KU  Kamakura and the tragedy of hopes Peak  Academy which was the very first killing  game crafted by Junko Enoshima  and speaking of when Junko did  eventually implement the tragedy that  sent a wave of despair  the world cocoa and the rest of the 70th  class would be sealed within hopes Peak  Academy by gin for their own safety  however Junko had infiltrated the class  erased their memories and forced them to  participate in a more complex killing  game now rather interestingly unlike  other students Kyoko did not even recall  what her ultimate talent was and for  much of this event she was presented as  quite an enigma despite this lack of  knowledge cooker skills as a detective  were not dulled in the slightest and she  proved absolutely essential in the  ensuing investigations as well as  subsequent class trials that would see  the deaths of all but six of the  students of the 78th class however  during this time Kyoko was one of the  more distant students preferring to keep  to herself and being very selective in  regards to her interactions the one  notable relationship she did form was  with the eventual ultimate hope Makoto  naegi as Kyoko greatly admired his  relentless optimism and it is strongly  hinted that the two developed an  attraction towards each other  in fact this bond became so strong that  when Makoto allowed himself to undergo a  failed execution in the fifth trial  Kyoko went on to risk her life to save  him as well as show him her scarred  hands as a sign of trust that the two  had developed ghosts by this time Kyoko  had also finally remembered that her  talent was the ultimate detective and  she and the remaining surviving students  joined forces and went on to defeat  Junko Enoshima thus ending the killing  game and allowing them to escape into  the outside world  shortly afterwards Kyoko joined the  Future Foundation and was eventually  made head of its fourteenth division  with her duties being to protect the  victims of juncos wave of despair as  well spread hope throughout the world in  the form of future foundation activities  but as part of this Kyoko was also  complicit with the efforts of a  classmate Makoto to rehabilitate the  remnants of despair by replacing them  into the near world program however  after this program was infected by a  virus carrying an AI Junko Enoshima  Kyoko along with Makoto and byakuya made  their way into the program to assist the  remnants of despair in defeating the  virus although this action would result  in Makoto being put on trial for treason  for the act of harboring the remnants of  despair and culminating in Kyoko Makoto  and Sue of other key future foundation  members being roped into a final killing  game during this particular killing game  individual restrictions were placed on  the participants with Geass forbidden  action being particularly cruel which  was passed in the forth time limit with  Makoto still being alive and so as it  appeared Kyoko went on to sacrifice  herself in favor of having Mikoto live  on telling him not to give up on hope No  matter what happens and that she would  always be there for him and while Kyoko  did appear to die following the passing  of the fourth time limit this was all  more or less according to plan as just  prior Kyoko had ingested QW the drug  made by one of the other participants of  the game which counted the lethal  effects of the poison injected into her  Yoko would then be revived by me consume  iki one of the remnants of despair that  Kyoko had had a hand in saving and thus  survived the final killing game  following this the Future Foundation  decided to rebuild hopes Peak Academy  with makoto as its new headmaster and it  is heavily implied to Kyoko serves  directly alongside him as vice principal  small fun facts about Kyoko kiri Giri  Kyoko's family named kiri Giri is formed  by kanji that can be read as folk kata  thus directly referencing her detective  lineage and just being a pretty damn  cool name in general Kyoko is one of the  four characters in the series to have  survived to killing games but the others  being her longtime love interest makoto  as well as AoE Asahina and Hajime Hinata  Kyoko is also one of the very rare  characters within the danganronpa  universe whose talent is not unique to  her alone as she shares the title of  ultimate detective with Shuichi Sahara  from danganronpa v3 and finally a truly  useless fact about underwear during her  school days Kyoko wore black briefs with  a ribbon decoration on the side which I  described as being able to quote obscure  her form which is almost certainly some  form of joke about being able to see  shadows on her skirt at various points  in the game but that pretty much does it  for Kyoko Kira Giri if you enjoyed this  video and the content this channel  produces in general then please do  consider donating to the new world  review patreon because the support of  all of your amazing people is what  continues to make this channel possible  and if patreon isn't quite your style  then please do leave this video a like  share or subscribe because it also helps  support this channel any pro  if you'd like to join the fun at any  time then please do head over to my  disco server where a wide array of  shenanigan retakes place on a daily  basis and finally please do comment with  who what or where you'd like to see  featured in the next danganronpa  [Music]  [Music]

